  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Peel the pumpkin and cut into 2cm chunks. Thickly slice the onion. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Cut the haloumi into 5mm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/244597/photos/large/prep_ingredients-89d8bc969a8be2a4109d094b6de93b20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast veggies: Put the pumpkin, onion, garlic, 2 tsp olive oil and 1 tsp honey in a large bowl, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Put on the lined tray and roast, turning halfway, for 25-30 mins until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/244598/photos/large/roast_veggies-16a4e96f59f903c6fc4e2861323b422b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make dressing: Meanwhile, put the chilli mustard, 2 tsp olive oil, 2 tsp red wine vinegar and ½ tsp honey in a large bowl, season with salt and pepper and whisk to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/244599/photos/large/make_dressing-2f40d798d8ab5b23ce5e6b0e17e39c29.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pan-fry haloumi: Put the pepitas in a cold medium frypan (see Kitchen 101) over medium heat. Toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until evenly golden. Remove from the pan. Heat 2 tsp olive oil in the pan over high heat. Cook the haloumi for 1-2 mins each side until golden. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/244600/photos/large/pan_fry_haloumi-5baface9c23c81deef8ca43665e278d9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the spinach, cranberries and pepitas to the dressing and toss gently to coat. Divide the salad among bowls, top with the roasted veggies and haloumi and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/244601/photos/large/serve_up-69bf1e3c5e3b0f593ca57ce1fecdfd84.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Starting with a cold pan ensures the seeds toast evenly and prevents them burning.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/244602/photos/large/kitchen_101-edb16103f8150d24df15f55647515d8f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
